WEBVTT

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.443
Ne pričamo samo o nekoliko
stranica jedinica i nula.

00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:33.052
Govorimo o milijardama
i milijardama

00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:34.385
jedinica i nula,

00:00:34.385 --> 00:00:37.026
više nego što 
itko može shvatiti.

00:00:37.026 --> 00:00:38.885
Iako to zvuči uzbudljivo,

00:00:38.885 --> 00:00:41.357
kada sam se počeo baviti cyberom —

00:00:41.357 --> 00:00:42.780
(Smijeh) —

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.173
kada sam se počeo baviti cyberom,
nisam bio siguran

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.866
da je prosijavanje 
jedinica i nula

00:00:46.866 --> 00:00:48.890
ono što želim raditi
cijeli život,

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.910
jer u mojim mislima,
cyber je značio

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:54.591
spriječiti da se 
bakino računalo zarazi virusom,

00:00:54.591 --> 00:00:57.789
spriječiti hakiranje
Myspace stranica,

00:00:57.789 --> 00:01:00.124
a možda, 
na svoje najslavnije dane,